---
cuisine: Turkish
servings: 6
portion: 40 g
---

Sautee minced @garlic{3} in #pan with around @olive oil{2%tbsp}

Add 1 diced @onion{1} once the garlic releases a smell. Sautee for around ~{2%minutes}

Add @tomato puree{3%tbsp} and mix

Add 1 diced @tomato{1}

Add @yellow pepper{1/4} and @red pepper{1/4}

Mix and add @salt{1%tsp}. Put a lid on

Add spices: @black pepper{1/4%tsp}, @paprika{1%tsp}, @chilli flakes{1/2%tsp}, @cumin powder{1/2%tsp}, @tumeric{1/4%tsp}, @cayenne powder{1/4%tsp}

Steam for a while

Add a splash of water and mix. Then put the lid on and let it cook for a while

Crack in @egg{6}. Put the lid back on and cook for ~{2%minutes} at low/medium heat

Sprinkle @coriander{} and serve